tribution systems. It is a very confusing world. We are invited to imagine
stories large ³ for IMAX screens and small ³ for mobile phones.
We need to be masters of linear  forms and Ɗ in experimental
story ผtures. We can see that the world of the У is changing
and we know that the old maps don’t help us Ƌ. As we each set out on
our ς seeking as always to generate new ideas, develop unforgettable
characters, and create effective θ stories, we are more than a little
